; Import library definition for the kernel32 entry points HYPRLODR uses.
; Converted to a .lib by llvm-dlltool in tools/build_windows.sh.
LIBRARY KERNEL32.dll
EXPORTS
CreateDirectoryA
CreateFileA
CreateThread
DisableThreadLibraryCalls
FindClose
FindFirstFileA
FindNextFileA
FreeLibrary
GetCommandLineA
GetCurrentProcessId
GetProcessHeap
GetModuleFileNameA
GetModuleHandleA
GetProcAddress
GetStdHandle
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
HeapReAlloc
LoadLibraryA
ReadFile
Sleep
WriteFile
CloseHandle
